IBM VGA 8x16 font (src/rgl/font/vga/IBM_VGA_8x16.bin)

IBM's MCGA/VGA (PS/2) video BIOS 8x16 font, taken from
https://github.com/spacerace/romfont/blob/73f2ba6849e7f1d8a58d5861e462bcf6bf169780/font-bin/IBM_VGA_8x16.bin,
whose repository carries no license. No license or copyright statement is
known for these bytes: clone VGA BIOSes (Cirrus Logic, Matrox, S3, Oak,
Tseng, Trident, NCR) carry them verbatim, and FreeBSD has shipped them since
its syscons cp437 fonts (share/vt/fonts/vgarom-8x16.hex) with no notice for
the font. Bitmap glyph shapes are generally not protected by copyright in the
United States, so these are assumed to be effectively public domain.

